</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">galdepth_z</code></p></td>
<td><p>float32</p></td>
<td><p>5-sigma galaxy (0.45" round exp) detection depth in <span class="math">\(z\)</span>-band (AB) mag.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">ebv</code></p></td>
<td><p>float32</p></td>
<td><p>Median <a class="reference external" href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1998ApJ...500..525S/abstract">SFD98</a> dust map E(B-V) extinction, in magnitudes, evaluated at <code class="docutils literal">BRICK_PRIMARY</code> objects in this brick.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">trans_g</code></p></td>
