</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">trans_r</code></p></td>
<td><p>float32</p></td>
<td><p>Median Milky Way dust transparency in <span class="math">\(g\)</span>-band, based on <code class="docutils literal">ebv</code>. See also <code class="docutils literal">MW_TRANSMISSION_R</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">trans_z</code></p></td>
<td><p>float32</p></td>
<td><p>Median Milky Way dust transparency in <span class="math">\(z\)</span>-band, based on <code class="docutils literal">ebv</code>. See also <code class="docutils literal">MW_TRANSMISSION_Z</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">cosky_g</code></p></td>
<td><p>float32</p></td>
<td><p>Estimated sky level in the coadded images (stacks) in <span class="math">\(g\)</span>-band <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-1" id="footnote-reference-1" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>1<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">cosky_r</code></p></td>
<td><p>float32</p></td>
