<td><p><a class="reference external" href="https://gea.esac.esa.int/archive/documentation//GDR2/Gaia_archive/chap_datamodel/sec_dm_main_tables/ssec_dm_gaia_source.html">Gaia</a> BP magnitude</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><p><code class="docutils literal">gaia_phot_bp_mean_flux_over_error</code></p></td>
